# The records lie as in an-export-read-while-its-file-runs-stops-by-name.ir: each request says completes=true, though early.cjs asks for ring.cjs while that runs. Link takes `count` for stored.
# `count` holds numbers alone and lies raw. Its type says no marker, so neither the type nor a box made by it tells that nothing is stored yet: the read is asked for the markers in its own form.
